            "review_text": "Roving40669216794\n1 contribution\n0\nCome experience beautiful places to make your day more meaningful\nFeb 2025 • Solo\nA wonderful afternoon with egg cream milk tea and croissants. Thank you Mojo for making my day more meaningful. Very delicious drinks and cakes, beautiful cozy space, friendly professional staff.\nInsider tip:\nA place worth experiencing. Here, in addition to delicious drinks, you can come for breakfast, lunch and dinner .\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 27, 2025",
