            "review_text": "salvadore F\n2 contributions\n0\nBad customer service and waiting just about everything which in the end a 5% charge on top of bill.\nAug 2024 • Business\nNot a good place for customers if you want service. Ignores several times and ask for follow up and as many workers and no service. I will not recommend it to anyone. On top of the bill was charged a 5% for what? I paid and will never be back again. Good luck waiting for half an hour for just about everything.\nInsider tip:\nTips are an option not a service fee for not working at all. No customer service.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 2, 2024",
